      <uighur>deyildekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>дийлдэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DEILDE-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. pass. of deil-] To be conquered, vanquished, or defeated, lose in a game; to lean to one side, be out of balance (as loads).</definition>
      <page>246</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠢ ᠲᠡᠭᠦᠨ ᠎ᠳᠦ ᠳᠠᠶᠢᠯᠳᠠᠯᠦᠭᠡ</unicode>
          <transcript>bi tegyn dy --lyge </transcript>
          <definition> Ihave been defeated by him</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
